---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Articles | TATTO LAB"
  description="TATTO LABで行っているAI、シミュレーション、ゲーム制作の実験と、そこから得られた知見をまとめています。"
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">ARTICLES</p>
      <h1>Articles</h1>
      <p class="lead">作って、試して、分かったことを残す。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="articles">
      <a class="article-card" href="/articles/inheritance-village-two-weeks">
        <div class="thumb">
          <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tattoqq9/inheritance-village/main/docs/assets/latest_clean_start_g2_material_deposit.png" alt="継承する村のGeneration 2素材納品時の2Dリプレイ" width="1600" height="900" />
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="meta"><span>LLM / MULTI-AGENT / COMPETITION</span><time datetime="2026-09-01">2026.09.01</time></div>
          <h2>コンペのために、Codexと2週間でLLMの村を作った</h2>
          <p>食料採取だけの小さな村から、感情日記、世代継承、ダンジョン、戦闘まで。提出までの2週間を振り返ります。</p>
          <strong>Read Article →</strong>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="article-card" href="/articles/virtual-guitar-ai">
        <div class="thumb">
          <img src="/images/guitar-ai/article-01/virtual-guitar-ai-cover.webp" alt="ギター切り抜きとHands Overlayを組み合わせた試作" width="1600" height="900" />
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="meta"><span>GUITAR AI / COMPUTER VISION</span><time datetime="2026-08-29">2026.08.29</time></div>
          <h2>Virtualな演奏動画を作りたくて、ギターを切り抜くAIを作っている</h2>
          <p>MediaPipe Handsから始まった、自分のギター専用Segmentation AIの試行錯誤。</p>
          <strong>Read Article →</strong>
        </div>
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  main { width: min(var(--content-wide), calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; }
  .hero { padding: 120px 0 80px; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .18em; }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 7.2rem); line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .lead { margin-top: 30px; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.55rem); }
  .articles { display: grid; gap: 22px; padding: 20px 0 100px; }
  .article-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, .85fr); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 22px; background: var(--surface); transition: transform 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease; }
  .article-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--border-strong); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
  .thumb { min-height: 360px; background: var(--media-bg); }
  .thumb img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .card-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 54px); }
  .meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-subtle); font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .meta span { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .card-body p { margin: 24px 0; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
  .card-body strong { color: var(--accent); font-size: .82rem; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .hero { padding-top: 80px; } .article-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .thumb { min-height: 0; aspect-ratio: 16/9; } .meta { flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; } }
</style>
